hik-barsha","title":["The Nepalese Fiscal Year (",["$","em",null,{"children":"Aarthik Barsha"}],")"]},{"depth":2,"url":"#bikram-sambat-bs-vs-gregorian-ad-comparison","title":"Bikram Sambat (BS) vs. Gregorian (AD) Comparison"},{"depth":2,"url":"#technical-implications-for-software-engineering","title":"Technical Implications for Software Engineering"},{"depth":3,"url":"#1-mathematical-algorithms-cannot-predict-month-lengths","title":"1. Mathematical Algorithms Cannot Predict Month Lengths"},{"depth":3,"url":"#2-comprehensive-calendar-mapping--annual-ashwin-verification","title":"2. Comprehensive Calendar Mapping & Annual Ashwin Verification"},{"depth":3,"url":"#3-database-architecture-recommendation","title":"3. Database Architecture Recommendation"},{"depth":3,"url":"#4-nepal-standard-time-npt","title":"4. Nepal Standard Time (NPT)"}],"full":"$undefined","children":[["$","script",null,{"id":"docs-breadcrumb-schema","type":"application/ld+json","suppressHydrationWarning":true,"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://nepali-pkg.date/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Docs\",\"item\":\"https://nepali-pkg.date/docs\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"What is Nepali Date? (Origination & Calendar)\",\"item\":\"https://nepali-pkg.date/docs/origination\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"id":"docs-techarticle-schema","type":"application/ld+json","suppressHydrationWarning":true,"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TechArticle\",\"headline\":\"What is Nepali Date? (Origination & Calendar) - Guide\",\"description\":\"Deep dive into the origins, history, astronomical foundation, calendar mechanics, and timeline of Bikram Sambat (विक्रम संवत्).\",\"url\":\"https://nepali-pkg.date/docs/origination\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"P