14a:["$","$L16b",null,{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 6,1 C 4.354992,1 3,2.354992 3,4 v 16 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 12 c 1.645008,0 3,-1.354992 3,-3 V 8 7 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 20.707031,6.2929687 l -5,-5 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 15,1 h -1 z m 0,2 h 7 v 3 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 3 v 11 c 0,0.564129 -0.435871,1 -1,1 H 6 C 5.4358712,21 5,20.564129 5,20 V 4 C 5,3.4358712 5.4358712,3 6,3 Z M 15,3.4140625 18.585937,7 H 16 C 15.435871,7 15,6.5641288 15,6 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg>","children":["$","$L16c",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"className":"line","children":["$","span",null,{"children":"(year % 4 === 0 && year % 100 !== 0) || (year % 400 === 0)"}]}]}]}]}]
14b:["$","p",null,{"children":["In Bikram Sambat, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"no such modular formula exists"}],". Because month lengths depend on the precise astronomical minute of the Sun's transit across constellations as observed from Kathmandu, month lengths are certified yearly by the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Nepal Panchanga Nirnayak Samiti"}],"."]}]
14c:["$","$L119",null,{"as":"h3","id":"2-comprehensive-calendar-mapping--annual-ashwin-verification","children":"2. Comprehensive Calendar Mapping & Annual Ashwin Verification"}]
14d:["$","p",null,{"children":"Because modular formulas cannot predict month lengths, reliable date libraries must embed pre-computed lookup matrices containing verified month lengths for historical and modern Bikram Sambat years."}]
14e:["$","p",null,{"children":["The ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Nepali Date Library"}]," embeds calendar mapping data spanning ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"1976 BS through 2100 BS"}]," (more than 124 years). Because the official Government of Nepal calendar for the upcoming year is released annually in the month of ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Ashwin (Ashoj)"}]," by the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Nepal Panchanga Nirnayak Samiti"}],", the library verifies dates up to the current active year and incorporates authoritative government updates annually upon publication."]}]
